maplecode --worktree login: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `maplecode fork`, `maplecode exec`, and `maplecode exec fork`
maplecode fork --worktree: `maplecode fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
maplecode fork --worktree --last: `maplecode fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
maplecode exec resume --worktree session: `--worktree` cannot resume an existing session; use `maplecode exec fork --worktree`
maplecode exec review --worktree: `--worktree` is not supported for code review
maplecode resume --worktree session: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `maplecode fork`, `maplecode exec`, and `maplecode exec fork`
maplecode archive session --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `maplecode fork`, `maplecode exec`, and `maplecode exec fork`
maplecode queue --thread session --message hi --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `maplecode fork`, `maplecode exec`, and `maplecode exec fork`
